{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path among powerful Sages, each sworn to a unique Coven Allegiance. Master an arsenal of spectacular spells across three disciplines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offensive magics to devastate your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive enchantments to protect your allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support incantations to turn the tide of battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/1e8be0757b883070864d365a352c98b0.avif?t=1773523119\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras_big/1e8be0757b883070864d365a352c98b0.webp?t=1773523119 width=1560 height=877 /></span><strong>Dynamic Team Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your fellow spellcasters in intense 3v3, 1v1, and 8-player Free-For-All\u00a0battles across whimsical, ever-changing Realms. Work together to claim powerful Relics while outmaneuvering rival teams through tactical spell combinations and coordinated assaults. Victory demands both individual skill and seamless team coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.poster.avif?t=1773523119\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.webm?t=1773523119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.mp4?t=1773523119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Depth</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse roster of Sages, each with unique spell loadouts and playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complex interplay between different Coven Allegiances</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple viable team compositions and strategies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced Action</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick, action-packed matches are perfect for both casual and competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fluid spell-casting system that rewards skill and timing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic objectives that keep every match fresh and exciting</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle Realm Challenges to gain XP and strengthen your Sage's abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exit Victorious in Realm Battles to unlock the full power of your Sage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the competitive ranks and prove your magical prowess</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.poster.avif?t=1773523119\" width=360 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.webm?t=1773523119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/dbcb3cec4b9a77f072603d34537950c4.mp4?t=1773523119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Battlefield Awaits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump into matches solo or gather your friends to form the ultimate magical strike team. With easy-to-learn but difficult-to-master gameplay, Coven: All Powerful offers an enchanting competitive experience that will keep you coming back for &quot;just one more match.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.poster.avif?t=1773523119\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.webm?t=1773523119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/c57b4f68d5cb47c064cce435822b02fd.mp4?t=1773523119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a seasoned spellslinger or new to the Realms, there's a place for you in the Coven. Choose your Sage, master your spells, and prepare for magical mayhem!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3205020?t=1773523119","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/e97337bc3367d119b902e40ea17ae7843dd1e357/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773523119","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/871bf180a69fea9aee6c4961ee0a015864d1e930/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773523119","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/871bf180a69fea9aee6c4961ee0a015864d1e930/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773523119","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3215830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the Coven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your path among powerful Sages, each sworn to a unique Coven Allegiance. Master an arsenal of spectacular spells across three disciplines:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offensive magics to devastate your foes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defensive enchantments to protect your allies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support incantations to turn the tide of battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/1e8be0757b883070864d365a352c98b0.avif?t=1773523119\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras_big/1e8be0757b883070864d365a352c98b0.webp?t=1773523119 width=1560 height=877 /></span><strong>Dynamic Team Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally your fellow spellcasters in intense 3v3, 1v1, and 8-player Free-For-All\u00a0battles across whimsical, ever-changing Realms. Work together to claim powerful Relics while outmaneuvering rival teams through tactical spell combinations and coordinated assaults. Victory demands both individual skill and seamless team coordination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3574b09bc7ccdbae1fed65cc7d44691f.poster.avif?t=1773523119\" width=360 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3205020/extras/3